  - key: PAYTABLE_SYMBOL_NAME_0
    value: <style=title><size=42>WILD</size></style>
  - key: PAYTABLE_SYMBOL_DESCRIPTION_0
    value: "<size=22>- Collecting Moon Wilds increases Linked Wilds Bet and\n   the
      chance to enter the Wild Party Bonus.\n- The higher the user's Bet, the more
      the Linked Wilds Bet \n   will increase.\n- Linked Wilds Bet is re-set once
      the Bonus Game begins, \n   but remains saved if the user exits during the base
      game. "
  - key: PAYTABLE_SYMBOL_PAYOUT_FORMAT
    value: '<b><size=24>5 <style=coinColor>{2:CommaNumber}</style>

      4 <style=coinColor>{1:CommaNumber}</style>

      3 <style=coinColor>{0:CommaNumber}</style></size></b>'
  - key: PAYTABLE_TITLE_ADDED_WILD_FEATURE
    value: <style=title><size=42>ADDED WILD FEATURE</size></style>
  - key: PAYTABLE_DESCRIPTION_ADDED_WILD_FEATURE
    value: "<size=24>- 30 to 50 Wilds are randomly added to the reel strip during
      Base Game and \n  are effective for one spin only."
  - key: PAYTABLE_TITLE_COMMUNITY_WILDS_BONUS
    value: <style=title><size=42>WILD PARTY BONUS</size></style>
  - key: PAYTABLE_DESCRIPTION_COMMUNITY_WILDS_BONUS
    value: '<size=24>- Users in the room collect Wilds and play the Bonus together
      when gauge is full.

      - User must have at least 60 Linked Wilds Bet to be eligible to play.

      - In the Wild Party Bonus, all users share the Wilds they collect.

      - In the Bonus, each user''s Linked Wilds Bet becomes the base bet.'
  - key: PAYTABLE_WAY_INFO
    value: <size=24><color=#00eaff>30 LINES</color></size>
  - key: PAYTABLE_BET_INFO
    value: '<size=24><color=#00eaff>Bet Per Line: 1</color></size>'
  - key: PAYTABLE_TITLE_LINES
    value: <style=title><size=42>LINES</size></style>
  - key: BUTTON_FREE_SPIN_START
